#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 50
#: rc.cpp:100 advanced/nfs/nfshostdlg.cpp:40
msgid "Host Properties"
msgstr "主機屬性"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 67
#: rc.cpp:103
msgid "&Name/address:"
msgstr "名稱/位址(&N):"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 107
#: rc.cpp:106
msgid ""
"<b>Name / Address field</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Here you can enter the host name or address.<br>\n"
"The host may be specified in a number of ways:\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>single host</i>\n"
"<p>\n"
" This is the most common format. You may specify a host either by an "
"abbreviated name recognized by the resolver, the fully qualified domain "
"name, or an IP address.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<i>netgroups</i>\n"
"<p>\n"
" NIS netgroups may be given as @group. Only the host part of each netgroup "
"members is consider in checking for membership. Empty host parts or those "
"containing a single dash (-) are ignored.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<i>wildcards</i>\n"
"<p>\n"
" Machine names may contain the wildcard characters * and ?. This can be used "
"to make the exports file more compact; for instance, *.cs.foo.edu matches "
"all hosts in the domain cs.foo.edu. However, these wildcard characters do "
"not match the dots in a domain name, so the above pattern does not include "
"hosts such as a.b.cs.foo.edu.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<i>IP networks</i>\n"
"<p>\n"
" You can also export directories to all hosts on an IP (sub-) network "
"simultaneously. This is done by specifying an IP address and netmask pair as "
"address/netmask where the netmask can be specified in dotted-decimal format, "
"or as a contiguous mask length (for example, either `/255.255.252.0' or "
"`/22' appended to the network base address result in identical subnetworks "
"with 10 bits of host).\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>名稱 / 位址欄位</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"您可在此輸入主機名稱或位址。<br>\n"
"主機可以多種方法指定:\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>單一主機</i>\n"
"<p>\n"
"這是最普遍的格式。您可以解析器認識的縮寫名稱、完全網域名稱（fully qualified "
"domain name）或 IP 位址指定主機。\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<i>網絡群組</i>\n"
"<p>\n"
"NIS 網絡群組可以 @群組格式指定。只有每個網絡群組成員的主機部份會用作檢查成員"
"資格。如沒有主機部份或包括單一連接號（dash (-)）的名稱會被忽略。\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<i>萬用字元</i>\n"
"<p>\n"
"機器名稱可包括萬用字元 * 和 ? 。這可使匯出檔案小一些；與個例子， *.cs.foo."
"edu 可配對所有在 cs.foo.edu 網域的主機。但這些萬用字元不能配對網域名稱中的點"
"（dot），所以以上樣式不包括a.b.cs.foo.edu 這些主機。\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<i>IP 網絡</i>\n"
"<p>\n"
"您可以同一時間將目錄匯出予 IP（子）網絡的所有主機。IP 位址和網絡遮罩對以位址/"
"網絡遮罩方法指定，而網絡遮罩可以以點分隔的十進位數格式或連續的遮罩長度（例"
"如，不論 `/255.255.252.0' 或加在網絡基底位址後的 `/22' 都指向同一個有 10 位元"
"主機的子網絡）指定。\n"
"</p>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 115
#: rc.cpp:132
msgid "&Public access"
msgstr "公眾存取(&P)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 122
#: rc.cpp:135
msgid ""
"<b>Public access</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"If you check this, the host address will be a single wildcard , which means "
"public access.\n"
"This is just the same as if you would enter a wildcard in the address "
"field.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>公眾存取</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"如您啟用此選項，主機位址會是單一一個萬用字元，代表公眾存取。\n"
"這和您在位址欄輸入一個萬用字元是一樣的。\n"
"</p>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 140
#: rc.cpp:142
msgid "Options"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 157
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/propsdlgplugin/propertiespagegui.ui line 264
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 157
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/propsdlgplugin/propertiespagegui.ui line 264
#: rc.cpp:145 rc.cpp:2790
msgid "&Writable"
msgstr "可寫入(&W)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 166
#: rc.cpp:148
msgid ""
"<b>Writable</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Allow both read and write requests on this NFS volume.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The default is to disallow any request which changes the filesystem\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>可寫入</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"在這 NFS 卷冊容許讀及寫。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"預設是不容許改變檔案系統\n"
"</p>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 174
#: rc.cpp:157
msgid "&Insecure"
msgstr "不安全(&I)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 183
#: rc.cpp:160
msgid ""
"<b>Insecure</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"If this option is checked, it is not required that requests originate on an "
"internet port less than IPPORT_RESERVED (1024).\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"If unsure leave it unchecked.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>不安全</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"如啟用此選項，來源的互聯網連接埠毋須大於 IPPORT_RESERVED (即 1024).\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"如不肯定，不要選。\n"
"</p>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 191
#: rc.cpp:169
msgid "&Sync"
msgstr "同步化(&S)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 200
#: rc.cpp:172
msgid ""
"<b>Sync</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"This option requests that all file writes be committed to disk before the "
"write request completes. This is required for complete safety of data in the "
"face of a server crash, but incurs a performance hit.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The default is to allow the server to write the data out whenever it is "
"ready.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>同步化</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"此選項使檔案的寫入在寫入要求完成前要真的寫入硬碟。這可避免因伺服器當機而損失"
"資料，但會影響效能。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"預設是容許伺服器只在有空時才將資料寫入硬碟。\n"
"</p>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 211
#: rc.cpp:181
msgid "No w&delay"
msgstr "不容許寫入延遲(&D)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 216
#: rc.cpp:184
msgid ""
"<b>No wdelay</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"This option only has effect if sync is also set. The NFS server will "
"normally delay committing a write request to disk slightly if it suspects "
"that another related write request may be in progress or may arrive soon. "
"This allows multiple write requests to be committed to disk with the one "
"operation which can improve performance. If an NFS server received mainly "
"small unrelated requests, this behavior could actually reduce performance, "
"so no wdelay is available to turn it off. </p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>不容許寫入延遲</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"此選項只在同時設定「同步」時才有效。 NFS 伺服器在正常情況下如果懷疑有個相關的"
"寫入要求正在進行或將要來到，它會延遲少許才將資料寫入硬碟。這樣令多個寫入可以"
"一次過完成，改善效能。如 NFS 伺服器接收的主要是沒有關連的要求，此舉會確實減低"
"效能，所以可以以「不容許寫入延遲」取消它。</p>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 224
#: rc.cpp:189
msgid "No &hide"
msgstr "不隱藏(&H)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 242
#: rc.cpp:192
msgid ""
"<b>No hide</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"This option is based on the option of the same name provided in IRIX NFS. "
"Normally, if a server exports two filesystems one of which is mounted on the "
"other, then the client will have to mount both filesystems explicitly to get "
"access to them. If it just mounts the parent, it will see an empty directory "
"at the place where the other filesystem is mounted. That filesystem is "
"\"hidden\".\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Setting the nohide option on a filesystem causes it not to be hidden, and an "
"appropriately authorized client will be able to move from the parent to that "
"filesystem without noticing the change.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"However, some NFS clients do not cope well with this situation as, for "
"instance, it is then possible for two files in the one apparent filesystem "
"to have the same inode number.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The nohide option is currently only effective on single host exports. It "
"does not work reliably with netgroup, subnet, or wildcard exports.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"This option can be very useful in some situations, but it should be used "
"with due care, and only after confirming that the client system copes with "
"the situation effectively.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>不隱藏</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"此選項建基於 IRIX NFS 提供的同名選項。在正常情況下，如一伺服器匯出兩個檔案系"
"統，而其中一個是掛載在另一個上的，客戶端就要同時掛載兩者才能存取它們。如它只"
"掛載父檔案系統，在另一個檔案系統掛載的地方它只會看到一個空的目錄。這個目錄就"
"是「隱藏」了。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"在檔案系統上設定不隱藏會令它不再隱藏，有合適權限的使用戶可以從父檔案系統移至"
"這個檔案系統，而不會察覺他已改變了存取的檔案系統。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"但是有些 NFS 用戶端不能正確地處理這種情況，例如它看見的同一個檔案系統中可以有"
"兩個檔案有著相同的 inode 號碼。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"不隱藏選項目前只在單一匯出主機上有效。在網絡群組、子網絡、或萬用字元匯出主機"
"中不太可靠。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"這個選項在某些情況下很有用，但必須小心使用，和必須確定客戶端能有效地處理這個"
"情況。\n"
"</p>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 250
#: rc.cpp:210
msgid "No su&btree check"
msgstr "不作子樹檢查(&B)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 268
#: rc.cpp:213
msgid ""
"<b>No subtree check</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"This option disables subtree checking, which has mild security implications, "
"but can improve reliability is some circumstances.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"If a subdirectory of a filesystem is exported, but the whole filesystem is "
"not, then whenever a NFS request arrives, the server must check not only "
"that the accessed file is in the appropriate filesystem (which is easy) but "
"also that it is in the exported tree (which is harder). This check is called "
"the subtree_check.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"In order to perform this check, the server must include some information "
"about the location of the file in the \"filehandle\" that is given to the "
"client. This can cause problems with accessing files that are renamed while "
"a client has them open (though in many simple cases it will still work).\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"subtree checking is also used to make sure that files inside directories to "
"which only root has access can only be accessed if the filesystem is "
"exported with no_root_squash (see below), even the file itself allows more "
"general access.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"As a general guide, a home directory filesystem, which is normally exported "
"at the root and may see lots of file renames, should be exported with "
"subtree checking disabled. A filesystem which is mostly read-only, and at "
"least does not see many file renames (e.g. /usr or /var) and for which "
"subdirectories may be exported, should probably be exported with subtree "
"checks enabled.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>不作子樹檢查</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"此選項停用子樹檢查，對保安有些微影響但在某些情況下可改善可靠性。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"如某一檔案系統的子目錄匯出了，但整個檔案系統未有匯出，當有 NFS 要求到達時，伺"
"服器不單必須檢查要存取的檔案是否在合適的檔案系統（這很容易），還要檢查該檔案"
"是在已匯出的樹狀結構裡（這個較難）。這個檢查就叫作子樹檢查"
"（subtree_check）。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"要進行這個檢查，伺服器必須在送給客戶端的「檔案識別碼（filehandle）」中包括檔"
"案位置的資訊。當有人開端了某個檔案，而另外有人將它們更名，可能會發生問題（雖"
"然大部份情況下都不會有問題）。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"子樹檢查亦用於確保如目錄內的檔案只能以 root 存取，它只有當以no_root_squash 選"
"項（見下面）匯出檔案系統時才能被存取，即使讓檔案本身容許更大的存取。\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"通常來說，在根部開始匯出的家目錄檔案系統很可能會發生很多更名事件，應以不作子"
"樹檢查的方式匯出。主要用作讀取，不會有很多檔名更名的檔案系統（例如 /usr 或 /"
"var），則應該以子樹檢查的方式匯出。\n"
"</p>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 276
#: rc.cpp:231
msgid "Insecure loc&ks"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 285
#: rc.cpp:234
msgid ""
"<b>Insecure locks</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"This option tells the NFS server not to require authentication of locking "
"requests (i.e. requests which use the NLM protocol). Normally the NFS server "
"will require a lock request to hold a credential for a user who has read "
"access to the file. With this flag no access checks will be performed.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Early NFS client implementations did not send credentials with lock "
"requests, and many current NFS clients still exist which are based on the "
"old implementations. Use this flag if you find that you can only lock files "
"which are world readable.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 303
#: rc.cpp:243
msgid "User Mapping"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 323
#: rc.cpp:246
msgid "All s&quash"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 328
#: rc.cpp:249
msgid ""
"<b>All squash</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Map all uids and gids to the anonymous user. Useful for NFS-exported public "
"FTP directories, news spool directories, etc. </p>"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 336
#: rc.cpp:254
msgid "No &root squash"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./advanced/nfs/hostprops.ui line 346
#: rc.cpp:257
msgid ""
"<b>No root squash</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Turn of root squashing. This option is mainly useful for diskless clients.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<i>root squashing</i>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Map requests from uid/gid 0 to the anonymous uid/gid. Note that this does "
"not apply to any other uids that might be equally sensitive, such as user "
"bin.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""

